---
// "?" opens this. Keys are handled in src/scripts/keys.ts
---
<dialog class="keys-help" id="keys-help" aria-label="Keyboard shortcuts">
<pre>BACKSLASH(1)                  User Commands

<b>NAME</b>
       backslash - keyboard navigation

<b>KEYS</b>
       j / k      scroll down / up
       n / p      next / previous post
       gg / G     top / bottom of the page
       /          filter posts
       ?          this help
       Esc        close</pre>
<form method="dialog"><button>[q]uit</button></form>
</dialog>
